===== Serial =====

→ port.serial Pin: TX, RX, GND, VCC (3.3v, *don't connect!*)
Speed: 115200 8N1

Access to CFE by pressing CTRL+C during boot. Once it displays "CFE>", you can enter CFE commands.

CFE on TP-Link archer c8 is limited (no webui).
